The *.astc and *.rgba files in this directory are data produced by running the
unmodified ARM astcenc 5.7.1 release binary (Apache-2.0, Copyright (c) 2011-2026 Arm
Limited, https://github.com/ARM-software/astc-encoder) on 128-bit blocks generated by
tools/gen_random_vectors.py from a fixed pseudo-random seed (no third-party content).

*.astc : a .astc file whose blocks are random or randomly configured (not compressor output).
vectors.tsv, fnv1a64 column : FNV-1a hash of astcenc's RGBA8 decompression of that file.

No astcenc source code or binary code is included here. The licence of the tool is
reproduced in ../../PROVENANCE.md by URL and hash; whether committing the compressed
outputs needs more than this notice is an open question (maintainer-question.md).
